{"id":"n18527-1-8","stage":5,"title":"개작 · 改编","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18527-1-8-1","ko":"소설의 내용을 그대로 영화화한 건가요?","zh":"这是直接把小说的内容拍成电影了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소설의","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내용을","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"3","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그대로","meaning":"原原本本地，原封不动地，如实地，照原样","explanation":"그대로：原原本本地，原封不动地，如实地，照原样","readings":[{"term":"그대로","audio":"/audio/ae35dc181aceaec58c58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93615","senseId":"2","lemma":"그대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화화한","meaning":"改编拍成电影","explanation":"영화：电影；-화하다：转变成相应形态，영화화하다 表示改编拍成电影；-ㄴ：修饰后面的名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"cb0f24046b508710","term":"내용","zh":"内容","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3","entryId":"72573","definition":"言语、文章、画作、电影等的情节；或指想借此传递的信息。","pronunciation":["내ː용"]},{"id":"ae35dc181aceaec5","term":"그대로","zh":"原原本本地，原封不动地，如实地，照原样","audio":"/audio/ae35dc181aceaec58c58.mp3","entryId":"93615","definition":"与其完全相同的。","pronunciation":["그대로"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f81dd5c820b7ea6fce1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18527-1-8-2","ko":"아뇨. 상당 부분에서 개작이 이루어졌습니다.","zh":"不是的，很多部分都进行了改编。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아뇨.","meaning":"不用，不是","explanation":"아뇨：不用，不是","readings":[{"term":"아뇨","audio":"/audio/ae1335e90b0f8f8380e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65978","senseId":"1","lemma":"아뇨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상당","meaning":"相当于，合","explanation":"상당：相当于，合","readings":[{"term":"상당","audio":"/audio/f93afa2b41f73c8905f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16458","senseId":"1","lemma":"상당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부분에서","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개작이","meaning":"改编，改写","explanation":"개작：改编，改写；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개작","audio":"/audio/37670036c091692cd757.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18527","senseId":"1","lemma":"개작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이루어졌습니다.","meaning":"实现，完成","explanation":"이루어지다：实现，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"이루어지다","audio":"/audio/1890e18ab93b5a9d8b8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71690","senseId":"2","lemma":"이루어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ae1335e90b0f8f83","term":"아뇨","zh":"不用，不是","audio":"/audio/ae1335e90b0f8f8380e3.mp3","entryId":"65978","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아뇨"]},{"id":"f93afa2b41f73c89","term":"상당","zh":"相当于，合","audio":"/audio/f93afa2b41f73c8905f7.mp3","entryId":"16458","definition":"等于某个程度的价格。","pronunciation":["상당"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"37670036c091692c","term":"개작","zh":"改编，改写","audio":"/audio/37670036c091692cd757.mp3","entryId":"18527","definition":"修改原来的作品重新制作；或指那样的作品。","pronunciation":["개ː작"]},{"id":"1890e18ab93b5a9d","term":"이루어지다","zh":"实现，完成","audio":"/audio/1890e18ab93b5a9d8b8b.mp3","entryId":"71690","definition":"变成如所愿或所想的。","pronunciation":["이루어지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16556256153b0920c916.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18527","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不是的，很多部分都进行了改编。","这是直接把小说的内容拍成电影了吗？","今天会议上要讨论的议题有多少个？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是直接把小说的内容拍成电影了吗？","今天会议上要讨论的议题有多少个？","不是的，很多部分都进行了改编。"],"answer":2}]}
